;
SWAPPABLE VOLUMES

MOUNT /L lists the available volumes.
MOUNT GAMES selects the GAMES volume on J:.
MOUNT GUIDES selects the documentation volume on J:.
DIR J: lists files in user area 0 of the selected volume.
DIR J1: lists user area 1. Other sets can occupy other user areas.

Mount a volume at the CP/M prompt before reading or running its files.
Selecting another volume changes J: for this shared CP/M session.
The permanent SIG/M and CPMUG collections remain available on P:.
Use HELP LIBRARY for archive browsing or HELP GAMES for online play.
